      "home.about.p1": "Krépin Diatta (born 25 February 1999 in Ziguinchor, Senegal) is a Senegalese professional footballer who plays as a right back for Ligue 1 side AS Monaco and the Senegal national team. Once known for his pace and dribbling as a right winger, he has successfully converted into an all-action right back and remains a key member of Senegal's \"golden generation\".",
