      "bio.intro.p1": "Krépin Diatta was born on 25 February 1999 in Ziguinchor, in Senegal's Casamance region. After spells with local side Santhiaba Ziguinchor and the Oslo Football Academy in Dakar, he quickly emerged as one of Senegal's most promising young wingers.",
      "bio.intro.p2": "In 2017 he moved to Europe, joining Sarpsborg 08 in Norway. His impressive displays in the Eliteserien quickly attracted attention from bigger European clubs.",
