      "bio.style.title": "Playing Style",
      "bio.style.p": "Since converting from right winger to right back, Diatta has kept his pace and forward drive while adding defensive discipline. He overlaps down the right, delivers crosses, and holds his own in one-on-ones — valuable in both phases of play.",
